<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLOs settle for modest gains, franc dips.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLOs settle for modest gains, franc dips.</headline>
<text>
<p>1620 GMT - Belgian OLOs end firmer but stripped of half their morning gains. Market eyes U.S. Treasury auctions but no correction expected and bullish sentiment intact for now.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.62% (5.64) BE286=, 6 bps over Bunds (6)  MEUR</p>
<p>*OLO fut +0.14 at 123.00 BGBc1 ; Mark/Bfr 20.6323/33 (6300/10)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.04/06% (04/06) IRGHWI01 ;1-wk repo 3.05/07 (05/08)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
